# 📄 Academic Note

This laboratory was completed as part of the **Machine Learning Laboratory** course to develop practical skills in applying Multi-Layer Perceptron (MLP) networks for time-series forecasting. The implementation provides a foundation for understanding deep learning-based forecasting techniques before exploring more advanced sequential models such as Convolutional Neural Networks (CNNs) and Long Short-Term Memory (LSTM) networks.

